Function declarations, expressions, arrow functions, parameters, return, hoisting


7-C
	
Scope & Closures
	
Global vs local scope, lexical scope, closures, variable shadowing


8-C
	
Arrays
	
Creation, indexing, push/pop/shift/unshift, splice, slice, map, filter, reduce


9-c
	
Objects
	
Properties, methods, nested objects, destructuring, Object.keys/values/entries


10-c
	
Strings
	
String methods, template literals, concatenation, escaping, length


11-c
	
Numbers & Math
	
